5.Explore the different issue types available in Jira (Epic, Story, Task, Bug). For each type, create a sample issue in your project and write one line explaining when you would use that issue type in a real Zomato or Swiggy-like app.
Answer :

Create these four sample issues in your Jira project:
1.) Epic – “Restaurant Search Feature”
Use an Epic for a large feature that contains multiple related stories and tasks, such as restaurant search.

2.) Story – “Search for restaurants by name”
Use a Story for a user-focused feature that provides value to customers.

3.) Task – “Integrate Restaurant API”
Use a Task for a specific technical activity required to complete a feature.

4.) Bug – “Search results not loading”
Use a Bug when an existing feature is not working as expected and needs to be fixed.

